    summaryRoman: 'Masnavi Daftar 2 ki hikayat: Chaar mukhtalif zuban bolne wale musafir angoor ke naam par larr paray halankay sab ka maqsad aik hi tha; dastaar o guftugu ke jhagray aur ittehad ka dars.',
