"Rest your agitated hearts, O creatures of the gloom! Why would a royal falcon covet your foul, decaying ruins? Keep your dust and damp crevices to yourselves! My true home is the palace of the Sultan; my perch is the sovereign's wrist; my sustenance is fresh quarry provided by royal hands. I am merely a traveler who lost his bearings in the fog. What interest could I possibly hold in your rotten wasteland?"
